sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Researcher
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant M as Local Ollama
    U->>A: Ask in project
    A->>P: Verify membership, choose versions and retrieve context
    opt Generative mode
      A->>M: Generate using bounded context
      M-->>A: Structured candidate result
    end
    A->>P: Save run, context, citations and assessment
    A-->>U: Answer or evidence gap
